---
title: Readme
description: Who I am and what this site is for.
---
Hi, I'm Alfath—a software engineer by day and hobby procrastinator by night. This is my corner of the internet to document memories, share my work, and think out loud.

I love deep, meaningful conversations with others, but since those only happen so often, writing became my way of having them with myself. Putting ideas into words helps me make sense of them.

Besides all that, home workouts keep me from losing my mind sometimes. That healthy dopamine hit never fails to ease the stress while giving my sedentary routine a much-needed break.

Want to get to know me better or start a conversation? Feel free to hit me up on my socials.
